#. な、何か変な事言ったかな…
#. ウソなんかついてないよ…？
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"D-Did I say something strange? But I'm not lying, I\n"
"swear!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかに、この議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

